<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Balabala·生活小记</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: "Microsoft Yahei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff5f9 0%, #f0eaff 45%, #e6f3ff 100%);
            color: #4a4a5a;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 70px 20px 50px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.6rem;
            color: #d87093;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: #7a7a90;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 30px;
            padding: 16px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin: 0 auto 40px;
            max-width: 700px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(216, 172, 255, 0.25);
        }

        nav a {
            color: #6a6a8a;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1rem;
            padding: 8px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            background-color: #ffe4f1;
            color: #d87093;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px 60px;
        }

        section {
            margin-bottom: 60px;
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(180, 160, 220, 0.18);
        }

        h2 {
            color: #9370db;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            border-left: 5px solid #ffd966;
            padding-left: 14px;
        }

        .gallery {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .gallery-item {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffeef8, #e1f5ff);
            border-radius: 18px;
            height: 200px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(180, 170, 220, 0.2);
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .gallery-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
        }

        .gallery-item img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .quote-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff0f6, #faf3ff);
            padding: 22px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: #5a5a7a;
            border: 1px solid #e8d8ff;
        }

        .song-item {
            padding: 14px 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f4ff, #fffacd);
            border-radius: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #5a5a7a;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(170, 190, 255, 0.2);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            color: #8a8aa0;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>King · 碎片收藏馆</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">收集照片、文字与喜欢的旋律，留住生活里的温柔碎片</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#gallery">相册画廊</a>
        <a href="#quotes">文字语录</a>
        <a href="#music">我的歌单</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">

        <section id="gallery">
            <h2>相册画廊</h2>
            <div class="gallery">
                <div class="gallery-item">
                    <img src="pic1.jpg" alt="照片">
                </div>
                <div class="gallery-item">
                    <img src="pic2.jpg" alt="照片">
                </div>
                <div class="gallery-item">
                    <img src="pic3.jpg" alt="照片">
                </div>
                <div class="gallery-item">
                    <img src="pic4.jpg" alt="照片">
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="quotes">
            <h2>文字语录</h2>
            <div class="quote-box">
                “生活里那些细碎美好的瞬间，都值得被好好收藏。”
            </div>
            <div class="quote-box">
                “慢慢来吧，所有的期待终会奔赴而来。”
            </div>
            <div class="quote-box">
                “把温柔留给自己，也把浪漫留给日常。”
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="music">
            <h2>我的歌单</h2>
            <div class="song-item">歌曲 01 - 歌手</div>
            <div class="song-item">歌曲 02 - 歌手</div>
            <div class="song-item">歌曲 03 - 歌手</div>
            <div class="song-item">歌曲 04 - 歌手</div>
        </section>

    </div>

    <footer>
        Balabala · 生活小记 | 2026
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
